PictuRAS API Gateway

Nginx forwards https://localhost:8080/api-gateway/ to Express and strips the
/api-gateway prefix. The gateway mounts /projects, /users and /subscriptions.
Protected routes read Authorization: Bearer <JWT>.

For a project under /projects/:user/:project:
- POST /img and /video accept multipart fields image and video, respectively.
- POST /tool adds an effect and POST /reorder changes the pipeline order.
- POST /process starts a run. GET /processing-status returns the authorized
  snapshot, and GET /process/url lists available result URLs.
- Versioned mutations send X-Project-Version. A stale version can return 409.

The handlers in routes/projects.js, routes/users.js and routes/subscriptions.js
define the request and response behavior.
